## Game Overview
{{NEWLINE}}
{{GAME_NAME}} is a {{GAME_INTERACTION_TYPE}} game where players {{#USES_PIECES}}place {{GAME_PIECE_TYPE}}s{{/USES_PIECES}}{{^USES_PIECES}}move {{GAME_PIECE_TYPE}}s{{/USES_PIECES}} on a {{#IS_SCROLLABLE}}{{DEFAULT_GRID_WIDTH}}x{{DEFAULT_GRID_HEIGHT}} scrollable grid{{/IS_SCROLLABLE}}{{^IS_SCROLLABLE}}{{DEFAULT_GRID_WIDTH}}x{{DEFAULT_GRID_WIDTH}} grid{{/IS_SCROLLABLE}}.
{{NEWLINE}}
